m-plugin/blob/master/LSP.md"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W4QeP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe02150a-1b5b-4dfd-832f-51f40ceac93a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"Kite(coc-kite)ってPython以外あまり有効になってるところみたことないんですけど、PHPもいけるんですね。意外","ts":"1620139079.086900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xyIkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8977229c-e683-413d-a57e-71f89f0adf58","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"TabNineやKiteはモデルデータ依存でしょうから、\nこの辺のツールをがしがし使う人があまりいなさそうなPHPは精度がイマイチそうな感じががが","ts":"1620139012.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E1O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85965a0c-25b5-4823-8cb6-d79148d98b6e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"言語によるんですかねー私はRust, Python, TSあたりで使ってますけどLSPの方がいい結果出してくれることが多いですね。（C++は両方やばい）","ts":"1620138908.084900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M7t9x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5cec13c-6055-48df-8a0b-b0c1a8459050","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"しかしKiteは月2500円と、TabNineの倍……","ts":"1620138699.083600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"moneybag","count":1,"users":["U016GRZN0GJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fkHl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c5cf86c-1ca8-4fc7-9361-ea5302a0d36c","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"Cocの設定をちょっといじったらPHPでも使えるようになったが、精度的にはまだTabNineのほうが賢い印象。\nただ、TabNineにはない補完候補を出すことがあるので、両方課金してマシンパワーで殴るのが最適解になりそう。","ts":"1620138601.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T2rA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d86a161a-17f4-4a90-a1b7-a61e69d55d0c","type":"message","user":"U016GRZN0GJ","text":"課金しました \u003chttps://gyazo.com/a7937db32760731343aef6f7146ef636\u003e","ts":"1620137808.081100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Gyazo Photo: ","id":1,"title_link":"https://gyazo.com/a7937db32760731343aef6f7146ef636","image_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/a7937db32760731343aef6f7146ef636.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Gyazo","service_icon":"https://gyazo.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://gyazo.com/a7937db32760731343aef6f7146ef636","original_url":"https://gyazo.com/a7937db32760731343aef6f7146ef636"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"spin_keizai","count":6,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U017BU3UZBQ","U72TB62UF","UD1FQV38V","UFP0GQZ4K","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nOgc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db1d10a4-ea09-4bb0-8e00-e5dec6d57493","type":"message","user":"U016GRZN0GJ","text":"なるほど、試してみようかな","ts":"1620137212.080800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g1I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c9126dd-5d26-49cc-93ea-2035a2381d79","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"課金すると変わるというのは本当","ts":"1620137066.080400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BTU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"627b5187-e861-41b0-8751-5f2debd604f9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"課金すると、リモートのモデル計算が使えてこちらはローカルの計算より軽いので","ts":"1620137054.080300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VKa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93936646-e636-4aa9-bf1b-826b3d924a06","type":"message","user":"U016GRZN0GJ","text":"以前、TabNine試したときはすごく重くなったんですよね。課金すると変わるのかな。","ts":"1620136864.080200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L9v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f12bb1c-5710-472e-b519-0e5f3d1163c5","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"それまでは課金TabNineを大切に酷使していきたい。","ts":"1620136665.077900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fmSx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df3336ec-e629-4ede-be13-06db5c947b8e","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"う、Kiteのvim(neovim)プラグインがPHP未対応。\n3か月後に対応してるか確認しよう。","ts":"1620136625.077600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P9brj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad88eb3e-88f5-4871-bfcc-372eaee01ab3","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"あっと私TabNine、Kite両方とも無課金（正確にはTabNineは昔の買い切り時代のやつ）なんで、課金したら性能変わるかも知れないのでそこはあしからず・・・","ts":"1620132535.076000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U016GRZN0GJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P+7X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8502c532-eb05-4d07-a0da-23032cf6373c","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/kiteco/vim-plugin/blob/master/LSP.md#neovim-lsp\u003e\nなぜか Novim-LSP になってますけど、これ vim-lsp の記述なのでこんな感じに書けば動くかもです(whitelist は allowlist に置き換えてくださいませ)","ts":"1620131684.074400","thread_ts":"1620131684.074400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: kiteco/vim-plugin","id":1,"title":"kiteco/vim-plugin","title_link":"https://github.com/kiteco/vim-plugin/blob/master/LSP.md#neovim-lsp","text":"The Kite plugin for Vim. Contribute to kiteco/vim-plugin development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/ce19b6bcf9764a777ae9f68d952c6d4bd4619616158b4c80ec5b50fe9342dc3b/kiteco/vim-plugin","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/kiteco/vim-plugin/blob/master/LSP.md#neovim-lsp","original_url":"https://github.com/kiteco/vim-plugin/blob/master/LSP.md#neovim-lsp"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":1,"users":["U016GRZN0GJ"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U016GRZN0GJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DcM/g"}]},{"client_msg_